      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "VCC = 3V3    GND = GND\nSCL ↔ P2-21/PB8    SDA ↔ P2-20/PB9    AD0 → GND (0x68)\nSCL / SDA 各 4.7 kΩ 上拉至 3.3 V",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
