      "seed": 20262849,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 20262849,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "【I2C1 / MPU6050】\nP2-21  PB8  U95 SCL\nP2-20  PB9  U96 SDA\n\n【左轮编码器 / TIM2】\nP1-3   PA0  U23 A\nP1-4   PA1  U24 B\n\n【右轮编码器 / TIM3】\nP1-7   PA6  U31 A\nP1-10  PA7  U32 B\n\n【TB6612 控制】\nP2-23  PB6  U92 PWMA\nP2-22  PB7  U93 PWMB\nP2-15  PC1  U16 AIN1\nP2-16  PC2  U17 AIN2\nP2-17  PC3  U18 BIN1\nP1-9   PC4  U33 BIN2\nP1-12  PC5  U34 STBY（默认低）\n\n【电源与调试】\nType-C 5V IN   GND P1/P2-39\n3V3 P1/P2-38（只作输出）\n核心 2×5P：PA9 U68 / PA10 U69\nSWD：PA13 U72 / PA14 U76",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "【I2C1 / MPU6050】\nP2-21  PB8  U95 SCL\nP2-20  PB9  U96 SDA\n\n【左轮编码器 / TIM2】\nP1-3   PA0  U23 A\nP1-4   PA1  U24 B\n\n【右轮编码器 / TIM3】\nP1-7   PA6  U31 A\nP1-10  PA7  U32 B\n\n【TB6612 控制】\nP2-23  PB6  U92 PWMA\nP2-22  PB7  U93 PWMB\nP2-15  PC1  U16 AIN1\nP2-16  PC2  U17 AIN2\nP2-17  PC3  U18 BIN1\nP1-9   PC4  U33 BIN2\nP1-12  PC5  U34 STBY（默认低）\n\n【电源与调试】\nType-C 5V IN   GND P1/P2-39\n3V3 P1/P2-38（只作输出）\n核心 2×5P：PA9 U68 / PA10 U69\nSWD：PA13 U72 / PA14 U76",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 14,
      "autoResize": true
    },
