      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "电机：红 M+ ← AO1\n      白 M- ← AO2\n编码器供电：\n蓝 VCC 3.3–5V  黑 GND\n黄 A → PA0    绿 B → PA1\nAB 相 · 11 PPR × 减速比\n6V：额定≤0.45A 堵转1.2A\n12V：额定≤1A 堵转2.3A\n轮 Ø65mm · 轴 Ø6mm D口\n四倍频计数 = 44 × 减速比",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "电机：红 M+ ← AO1\n      白 M- ← AO2\n编码器供电：\n蓝 VCC 3.3–5V  黑 GND\n黄 A → PA0    绿 B → PA1\nAB 相 · 11 PPR × 减速比\n6V：额定≤0.45A 堵转1.2A\n12V：额定≤1A 堵转2.3A\n轮 Ø65mm · 轴 Ø6mm D口\n四倍频计数 = 44 × 减速比",
