      "versionNonce": 20266729,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**安全与抗干扰**",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**安全与抗干扰**",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 22,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "safety-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 832,
      "y": 1267,
      "width": 676,
      "height": 107,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group-safety"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 20266826,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 20266826,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• 所有电源与逻辑模块共地；电机功率不得取自开发板。\n• STBY 上电默认低；故障、倾角超限、I2C 超时立即停机。\n• 电机端加 100 μF 电解 + 0.1 μF 陶瓷电容，靠近功率级布置。\n• MPU6050 与电机线分离、短线连接并刚性固定。\n• 电池带 BMS/保护板，充电器与电池化学体系匹配。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• 所有电源与逻辑模块共地；电机功率不得取自开发板。\n• STBY 上电默认低；故障、倾角超限、I2C 超时立即停机。\n• 电机端加 100 μF 电解 + 0.1 μF 陶瓷电容，靠近功率级布置。\n• MPU6050 与电机线分离、短线连接并刚性固定。\n• 电池带 BMS/保护板，充电器与电池化学体系匹配。",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15,
      "autoResize": true
    },
