      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "**图例与网络约定**",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "**图例与网络约定**",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 22,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "legend-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 1267,
      "width": 748,
      "height": 107,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1f2937",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group-legend"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 20267117,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 20267117,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "红线：电机功率 / 电源   黑线：GND   蓝线：控制信号\n绿线：编码器信号       紫线：I2C       灰线：调试\nP1/P2-n：排针第 n 位；Uxx：LQFP100 第 xx 脚。\n3V3 / GND 标签表示同一网络，图上不重复画长线。\n“← / →”表示器件端口与 MCU 引脚的对应关系。",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "红线：电机功率 / 电源   黑线：GND   蓝线：控制信号\n绿线：编码器信号       紫线：I2C       灰线：调试\nP1/P2-n：排针第 n 位；Uxx：LQFP100 第 xx 脚。\n3V3 / GND 标签表示同一网络，图上不重复画长线。\n“← / →”表示器件端口与 MCU 引脚的对应关系。",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gnd-glyph-1",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 1612,
      "y": 1268,
